$('#help').onclick=()=>modal('Stay a little longer.',`<p><strong>Overview:</strong> drag to orbit, scroll to zoom, click artworks or signs. <strong>Walk:</strong> drag to look, use WASD or arrows to move, Q / R to turn, and E to inspect the object ahead. Touch movement buttons appear on mobile.</p><p>The four room buttons let you travel directly. “Look closer” makes every room object accessible without aiming. “Artwork index” always holds every work in the building.</p><p>Generate buzz to advance the fictional redevelopment. Find six tenant records to unlock the rooftop assembly. Only your tenant file is saved on this device; pressure resets when you reload. No live visitor counts or financial data are used.</p><p>This is an imagined NYC industrial building, not a replica of a real address. Architecture and stories were authored for the exhibition. Original art: MLow. Brick material: reused ImageGen texture from The Last Bodega.</p><p><button id="reset">Start a fresh visit</button> <a href="credits.html">Credits</a></p>`);document.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.id==='reset'){pressure=0;reclaimed=false;evidence.clear();try{localStorage.removeItem('mlow-tenants-v1')}catch{}updateWorld();$('#modal').close();go('loft')}});
